# App versioning

Source of truth: `app/build.gradle.kts` (`versionName`, `versionCode`).

When shipping user-visible or behavior changes in this repo, **bump version in the same edit**:

- **PATCH** — fixes / polish only
- **MINOR** — new capability or screen
- **MAJOR** — breaking data or large UX reset

Always `versionCode += 1` when `versionName` changes. Do not hardcode the version in UI (use `BuildConfig.VERSION_NAME`).

Details: `AGENTS.md` → Versioning.
